From: Duotek
Subject: [PATCH 0002] legacy and OpenDocument add-ons: relative import of the companion runtime

@silurus/ooxml-legacy-office 0.90.0 (dist/legacy-source-CFRuXN53.js) and @silurus/ooxml-opendocument 0.90.0
(dist/odf-source-CcsC38G5.js) import the companion runtime by the bare specifier "@silurus/ooxml/internal/companion".
A page without an import map cannot resolve it, and the viewer CSP (script-src without 'unsafe-inline') forbids an
inline import map. Point both at the copy of the stock file internal-companion.mjs (from @silurus/ooxml 0.90.0 dist)
that sits next to them in static/lib/silurus/. The patch changes one string in each file.
Apply from static/lib/silurus/ with: patch -p1 < 0002-...patch   (paths below are a/ b/ relative)

---
